      "source": [
        "The left panel shows what the extra fifty-one output units bought. The logit's\n",
        "baseline is a step function on nine bands, so its fitted hazard is flat across\n",
        "months four to six and again across months thirteen to eighteen, whereas the head\n",
        "follows the peak at month five and the decline after it month by month. The right\n",
        "panel shows what they did not buy: the three cumulative curves are within half a\n",
