        "the same marginal event counts.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Does the advantage survive the out-of-time split?\n",
        "\n",
        "Credit lecture 4 and 5 asked this of the twelve-month PD network and found the\n",
        "advantage narrowed. The same question is sharper here, since the out-of-time test\n",
        "loans are recent and therefore observed for only a few months each, so the test\n",
        "cells sit overwhelmingly in the low-hazard first year and the deviance level is not\n",
